# Tests

Follow `docs/testing.md`. Run `composer test`. Keep `SecurityContractTest` green.

## Required

- New production behavior → unit test next to the matching `tests/Unit/…` folder (mirror `src/`)
- No real MySQL/PayPal/Discord. `createMock` or an in-file `Fake*` subclass
- Exception assertions use **i18n keys** (`expectExceptionMessage('admin.roles.reserved_slug')`)
- Reset `$_GET` / `$_POST` in `tearDown` when the SUT reads them
- New POST/grid/Twig/SQL/ACL/audit/rate-limit rules belong in `SecurityContractTest`, not a one-off skip
- Do not add HTTP integration tests unless a second suite exists
